# Mau bien moi truong cho VnSearch.
#
# CACH DUNG:
#   1. Chep tep nay thanh `.env` (nam canh docker-compose.yml).
#   2. Dien gia tri that.
#   3. `docker compose up -d --build` se tu doc `.env`.
#
# Tep `.env` da nam trong .gitignore. Tep `.env.example` NAY thi duoc commit —
# no la tai lieu ve nhung gi can dat, khong chua bi mat nao.


# --- BAT BUOC ---

# Khoa quan tri cho /api/admin/**. Khong co khoa thi ung dung KHONG khoi dong.
#
# Cac endpoint nay dieu khien crawler: chung khien may chu di tai mot URL tuy y
# roi dua noi dung vao chi muc cong khai. De mo la mot lo hong SSRF hoan chinh,
# khong chi la "API khong co xac thuc".
#
# Sinh khoa:
#   Linux/macOS : openssl rand -hex 32
#   PowerShell  : -join ((1..64) | % { '{0:x}' -f (Get-Random -Max 16) })
#
# Toi thieu 16 ky tu.
ADMIN_API_KEY=doi-gia-tri-nay-truoc-khi-chay


# --- TUY CHON (co gia tri mac dinh hop ly) ---

# Mat khau PostgreSQL. Dung CHUNG cho ca dich vu postgres lan backend trong
# docker-compose, nen doi o day la doi ca hai — khong the lech nhau.
# Mac dinh: vnsearch
#POSTGRES_PASSWORD=

# Nguon goc duoc phep goi API (CORS). Mac dinh la dev server cua Vite.
# Mac dinh: http://localhost:5173
#APP_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=

# Mo hinh cham diem: tfidf | bm25
# bm25 dat MRR cao hon (0,9093 so voi 0,8758) - xem docs/EVALUATION.md
# Mac dinh: tfidf
#APP_RANKING_SCORER=


# --- BONG DA (profile `football`) ---

# Khoa API-Football, lay mien phi tai https://www.api-football.com/
#
# KHONG bat buoc, va day la khac biet co chu y so voi ADMIN_API_KEY o tren.
# Thieu ADMIN_API_KEY nghia la mo toang mot endpoint khien may chu di tai URL
# do nguoi la chon — mot lo hong, nen ung dung tu choi khoi dong. Thieu khoa
# duoi day chi nghia la khong co ti so that: football-service lui ve lich thi
# dau mau sinh theo gio hien tai, va giao dien van chay day du.
#
# Goi mien phi cho 100 luot goi ra ngoai moi ngay. Service tu giu lai 5 luot
# lam dem (FOOTBALL_DAILY_BUDGET=95) va dem moi ket qua 15 phut, vi 24 gio
# chia cho 95 ra dung 15,2 phut. Chi tiet: football-service/README.md
#FOOTBALL_API_KEY=
